// This file lists what 'strings' should not be replaced
// with odd mumblings when you try to talk while sleeping.
//
// The first line is the replacement line, this string will
// be used to fill in words that are not matched in here.
//
// Each line number _MUST_ be sequential, starting from 1
// the data on each line is just a text string that will
// Not be replaced by the text_filter_sleep functions.
//
// NOTE: longer strings strings should be up towards the top
// of the file, as once we match a shorter string, we
// don't bother checking if we could have matched a longer
// version

